#: ../../tools/depmap_tools.rst:32 591fe4e980314704984c4c5cb2d015d1
msgid ""
"**Description**: Analyzes gene-gene correlations from DepMap CRISPR "
"knockout screening data. This tool validates genetic interactions using "
"empirical cell viability data from 1,320+ cancer cell lines in the DepMap"
" 24Q2 dataset. It determines if two genes have correlated knockout "
"effects, providing insights into genetic dependencies and synthetic "
"lethal relationships."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：分析来自DepMap CRISPR敲除筛选数据的基因-基因相关性。本工具使用DepMap "
"24Q2数据集中1,320多个癌细胞系的实证细胞活力数据验证基因交互作用。它能够判断两个基因的敲除效应是否相关，从而提供关于基因依赖性和合成致死关系的见解。"

#: ../../tools/depmap_tools.rst:34 6af00eb4173e496aa1853233f3400732
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/depmap_tools.rst:36 2408d11656e6455ba0c9800e98a5acd8
msgid ""
"``gene_a`` (string) (required) First gene symbol for correlation analysis"
" (e.g., 'BRAF', 'TP53'). Must use standard HUGO gene nomenclature."
msgstr "``gene_a``（字符串）（必填）用于相关性分析的第一个基因符号（例如：'BRAF'、'TP53'）。必须使用标准的HUGO基因命名法。"

#: ../../tools/depmap_tools.rst:39 861ff56a3ad244f58db4304563afbb65
msgid ""
"``gene_b`` (string) (required) Second gene symbol for correlation "
"analysis (e.g., 'MAPK1', 'MDM2'). Must use standard HUGO gene "
"nomenclature."
msgstr "``gene_b``（字符串）（必填）用于相关性分析的第二个基因符号（例如：'MAPK1'、'MDM2'）。必须使用标准的HUGO基因命名法。"

#: ../../tools/depmap_tools.rst:42 6292b856470e4990b4aba6916e7e5a54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``data_dir`` (string) (optional) Path to directory containing DepMap "
"correlation matrices. If None, uses DEPMAP\\_DATA\\_PATH/depmap\\_24q2."
msgstr ""
"``data_dir``（字符串）（可选）包含 DepMap 相关矩阵的目录路径。如果为 None，则使用 "
"DEPMAP_DATA_PATH/depmap_24q2。"

